Attribution
-----------
Mention somewhere that the source is mcp-mirror, with a link to the project.
For example:

    Support data from mcp-mirror (https://github.com/…/mcp-mirror), CC BY 4.0.

If you modify the data, indicate that you changed it.

Why this license
----------------
The data is meant to be reused. A framework maintainer should be able to embed
their own support row in their documentation, a CI tool should be able to depend
on the aggregate, and anyone should be able to fork the tables. Attribution is
the only condition, which is the same arrangement caniuse.com uses for its
browser support data.

