a measurement, not a badge of approval.

Corrections
-----------
Every cell is generated by a deterministic scan and is meant to be reproducible.
If a cell is wrong, or your framework has shipped a change, open a pull request
against `data/capabilities/`, see CONTRIBUTING.md.
